  Description: "COMPANION / UNCOMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nEach FOOD purchased adds
    +1 flat melee AND +1 flat ranged team damage per Roshi talent. Hero maximum HP
    loses 0.5 per food per talent, up to 20 HP lost. Applied in the next prepared
    battle.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nChampion / Health correction: +2.5%\nChampion
    / Maximum health: -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces
    support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nA dockworker who carried a
    vessel's anchor inland when its harbour disappeared. The chain proves the harbour
    existed. They seek the crew to ask whether it is time to put the weight down.\r\nPERSONAL
    PASSIVE\nEvery 4s, chill enemies within 2.313 units: 1.5s normally, 0.6s on bosses.\r\n\nNamed
    talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not
    multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale
    separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: tidal, resolve. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment;
    two equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
